Nersissa - the packages of portia in a panel: the categories at the left, the packages of the
chosen category at the upper right, the description of the chosen package below it

  Nersissa.Open      the panel in a viewer (from a shell, without the desktop: in a window of its own)

A middle click on a category lists its packages; a middle click on a package describes it.
[x] marks an installed package, [ ] one that is not installed, [u] one with a newer version in the
tree, [-] one that has nothing for this machine (its modules are for other architectures). Install (Remove, when the package is installed) and Upgrade run portia.Install /y and
portia.Remove /y; Sync gets the newest tree (portia.Sync). portia's messages go to System.Log.

  portia.Help        portia's own commands
